Package: descriptiveStats
Title: Descriptive Statistics for Numeric Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mutong", "Zhang", , "mandy.memory98@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provide functions for calculating descriptive statics,
    including mean, median, mode, 1st quartile, 3rd quartile, and
    interquartile range. Ensures quality standards through handling edge
    cases and providing error messages for invalid inputs.
